data: {"id": "d3b0efeaf3204837-thinking-parallel_evidence-1134", "run_id": "d3b0efeaf3204837", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "---\n\n# 证据结论\n\n## 已确认事实\n\n| 维度 | 事实 |\n|------|------|\n| **当前状态** | Pod 仍处于 **Pending**，容器 `app` 等待原因 = **ImagePullBackOff**，未恢复 |\n| **镜像引用** | `registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing` (imagePullPolicy=Always) |\n| **kubelet 事件原文** | `lookup registry.invalid on 127.0.0.53:53: no such host` |\n| **Prometheus 指标** | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason=1` with reason=`ImagePullBackOff`; `kube_pod_status_phase=1` (Pending); restarts=0 |\n| **日志/链路** | Elasticsearch 日志 coverage=empty；DeepFlow flow + ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1788767661633, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

