data: {"id": "d3b0efeaf3204837-final", "run_id": "d3b0efeaf3204837", "seq": 1139, "ts_ms": 1788767677553, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-nqrzv` | ImagePullBackOff | Pod workload-65b7f54794-nqrzv处于ImagePullBackOff状态 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Failed to pull image \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\": ... dial tcp: lookup registry.invalid on 127.0.0.53:53: no such host` (fact-3cd50d014952) | 确诊镜像仓库域名 DNS 解析失败的具体错误。 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason: ImagePullBackOff` (fact-0d475311300f) | 说明容器因拉取失败已进入指数退避重试状态。 |\n| 3 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"ImagePullBackOff\"} = 1` (fact-131e2cffc83a) | 验证了容器处于 ImagePullBackOff 状态的持续性。 |\n| 4 | K8s State | kubernetes | `pod.phase: Pending`, `ContainersReady: False` (fact-3f2ca3a8618d, fact-ea973ab73bba) | 确认 Pod 因容器未就绪而卡在 Pending 阶段。 |\n\n**证据关联说明：**\nKubernetes 事件中的 `no such host` 直接解释了 K8s 状态 `ImagePullBackOff` 及 Metric 数据 `waiting_reason=ImagePullBackOff` 的成因；所有维度一致指向镜像拉取受阻。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod配置使用了无效域名 registry.invalid 作为镜像仓库 → kubelet执行镜像拉取时域名DNS解析失败(no such host) → 镜像拉取中断并持续重试导致ErrImagePull转ImagePullBackOff → Pod状态卡在Pending/ContainerWaiting\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为**镜像仓库域名 `registry.invalid` 无效导致 DNS 解析失败**。\n\n证据支撑：\n1. **直接证据**：K8s 事件明确记录了 DNS 查询失败 (`lookup registry.invalid ... no such host`)，证明底层网络解析不可达（见证据 1）。\n2. **状态佐证**：容器等待原因 (`ImagePullBackOff`) 和 Pod 状态 (`Pending`) 均与镜像拉取失败导致的容器无法启动现象完全吻合（见证据 2, 4）。\n3. **数据一致性**：Prometheus 指标监控到的 `ImagePullBackOff` 计数与 K8s 侧状态保持同步，排除了瞬时波动导致的可能（见证据 3）。\n\n由于容器无法启动，Logging 与 Tracing 维度自然为空，此缺失符合预期，不影响上述结论的成立。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 59.9s\n├─ 问题定位: 15.6s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 35.1s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-nqrzv: 35.1s (Evidence 28.4s, RCA 6.6s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.1s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-nqrzv**: pod-imagepull-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 59.942, "metrics": {"run_id": "d3b0efeaf3204837", "mttr": {"value": "59.9s", "seconds": 59.94853925704956, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-imagepull-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 59948.53925704956, "llm_calls": 12, "llm_duration_ms": 56331.06279373169, "tool_calls": 9, "executed_tool_calls": 9, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 9, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 7677.29115486145, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 3255.5298805236816}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": 